  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\">此模組已停止維護。請改查看此模組</span></strong><br><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">|</span></em><br><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">V</span></strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaiju-calamity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_d3b5e61b-b026-494a-b7dc-8b936bc7ddb8.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">我目前已無暇繼續開發此模組，這代表除非我決定從頭重建（大概不會），否則此模組將不再更新。若你喜歡這個模組的概念，很抱歉我目前無法繼續；未來或許會推出類似作品，但暫不在此時。</span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_e85d9462-85a3-4b37-af63-9e3799069b9b.png\" width=\"808\" height=\"121\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/891/449/256/256/638332962331987353.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/543/777/256/256/637874731161865623.jpeg\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/206/15/256/256/636953619080869513.png\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/190/975/256/256/636857615673605328.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/i-wanna-skate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/172/256/256/638026810692191323_animated.gif\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/domestication-innovation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/505/991/256/256/637823693530658983.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/847/183/256/256/638246399784227999.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"77\" height=\"77\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_8476ca41-7875-40c3-853d-b6537e0bd3f2.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; <em>震動哥吉拉（Tremorzilla），一位孤獨的黑幫成員，一位不受約束的國王，擁有無人能測試的力量。直到現在！隆重推出 Alex 模組的附加模組；黑幫之王。雖然這個模組「技術上」並非真正的附加模組，但我稱它為「非正式附加模組」；意思是它設計為與特定模組搭配遊玩。隨著更新持續進行，除非是除錯更新，否則將加入新的黑幫成員。你不僅能讓黑幫成員相互對戰，還能馴服其中一些成員與朋友對抗，或聯合起來擊敗其他黑幫。</em></p>\n<p><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_fd2b24b2-41e4-4ed6-87b4-306fa304967b.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"415\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_032c3abd-84de-4611-bcbb-7f2c2fd2f763.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_2d29ec37-a1b1-4913-96bc-2c118052b064.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_b011d9d6-a0db-43b7-8457-c56195ec62bb.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_09a6adcf-1b52-475c-b7c6-3e8bd6b389d0.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_7f7d95bb-664e-4c84-bd08-057a82780989.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_40d45189-dc45-42ce-8f5d-c24e6c615a41.png\"></p>\n<p>更多資訊可於此處查看 -<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1XvVy9Oawis_9BWJYDW_5Q71C8AY49AIt7d2ZB55gvdw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_bab66482-be2e-49c2-bba4-3ff416e07ee4.png\"> </a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_9fa55cc4-2cdc-4a2a-b1cb-64f185bbb895.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;- 特別感謝東寶（Toho）創作了哥吉拉這部精彩的系列作品，並向啟發每位黑幫成員的原型致敬。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;- 本模組使用 MCreator 製作，如果您喜歡此附加模組的內容，歡迎前往他們的網站給予支援。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;- 特別感謝 Alex 創作震動哥吉拉，並以此向哥吉拉致敬。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@gigablast0228\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_cd24aec1-4595-4653-bb8e-082aafa90558.PNG\" width=\"187\" height=\"135\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/HdzVe2QT3k\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1005066/description_5f734a2a-bf16-40cc-8c1c-fe9b9df9666a.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"145\"></a></p>",
